{"c":[{"id":"4078d7c411ce74e328e7d384205a21789896da17eaa37545962f39ad53aba872","sum":"AGENT_BIN vs CLI_NAME; VISION/ROADMAP retired for README+atlas+notes+memory-bank. tox py311-py314 no result cache; nested recall; skipped-a-pack on bad sibling; script is the only writer.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"5e4f97413b312154574a52b782dc0223d281329c033146c1f7175c8dbb73e1a5","sum":"Run: uses AGENT_BIN; help catalog uses CLI_NAME. VISION/ROADMAP retired; living docs are README, docs/architecture/ (atlas), docs/notes.md leftovers, and the memory-bank.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"667b5bd40e9be23ddeec380c5631a3fc8f731cf58d56db154c12dedfa451142e","sum":"Run: line uses AGENT_BIN (.summem/summem); help catalog uses CLI_NAME. VISION/ROADMAP sunset; living docs are README, docs/, and the memory-bank.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T023238Z-bbf825b6f524dcb6","text":"Nap Run: line uses AGENT_BIN (.summem/summem), same as the baked prompt; usage_text keeps CLI_NAME (summem).","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T025054Z-8222dbc737ce85a4","text":"VISION.md and ROADMAP.md are being sunset: leftovers go under docs/; README and memory-bank become the living docs; VISION is no longer the design contract.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"5e022ef533bec84293259aa4a3c815b8633f4e3e47847b355f86fca71dea8117","sum":"VISION.md and ROADMAP.md retired. Living docs are README, docs/architecture/ (the atlas), docs/notes.md leftovers, and the memory-bank. VISION is not the contract.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T025220Z-1a52749b783612ee","text":"docs-sunset plan: VISION/ROADMAP retire; architecture lives at docs/architecture/; leftovers (sqlite, hooks, cover(T), pack-size, hot margin) at docs/notes.md; README is the public face.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T030457Z-f1b0d73acb7f8b59","text":"VISION.md and ROADMAP.md are gone. Living docs are README, docs/architecture/, docs/notes.md, and the memory-bank. The architecture page is the atlas; VISION is not the contract.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"746cce2a386de2cd57d2f77ca19b292c0189cb60363f6c86944d9fead44d9a99","sum":"tox is py311-py314 pytest, no result cache unless proven on this suite; recall matches nested nap captions; zoom/recall warn 'skipped a pack' on an unreadable sibling children file (wake silent). Script-written files are part of the work; the script is the only writer.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"29530a97880a269e660dbdfe6943053f229dc80d93cafa9e9c7e269e0e3077e7","sum":"tox is the pytest suite on CPython 3.11–3.14 (no 3.10; no test-result cache unless proven on this tmp_path/worktree suite); recall matches nested nap captions; zoom/recall print 'skipped a pack' on stderr for an unreadable sibling children file; wake stays silent","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T034719Z-9ead1d6adb1f23f2","text":"Niko L2 tox-pytest-runner: one tox command for pytest on CPython 3.11–3.14 (no 3.10); skip test-result cache unless proven on this tmp_path/worktree suite","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T035449Z-38690d9f52484de6","text":"recall matches nested NapChild.sum captions; zoom/recall print 'skipped a pack' on stderr when they skip an unreadable sibling children file; wake stays silent","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"1cd145ba45ef49e6f3e7ca4db21d5e5f372f7e8b3109cdcf8637f9501cb76952","sum":"tox is the suite (py311-py314, no result cache). Files the script writes are part of the work: git-add them; the script is the only writer.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T040400Z-6f72c4e24f7307a3","text":"tox is the suite command: tox.ini package=skip, py311-py314, no test-result cache; 211 pytest. This uv only had 3.14.0rc3.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T044725Z-82b67eae5e042401","text":"After note or nap, git add the files the script wrote and commit them; the script stays the only writer.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"97fbdbf480d21d0c8108533b22cd6c3d96c8563889ceb0cfb6dd24d4250c8f17","sum":"Script-written files are part of the work (not untracked). Note membership is clone-portability; do not name OptMem in the prompt. Too long: N/limit L; unknown id on identity-miss says copy from wake. Onboarding is docs/agents-prompt.md lockstep; TDD skips consumer Actions YAML.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"0b347fe3d88d59693652675b59b880685fde23691a41f3118fda96c9747b7d7b","sum":"Files the script writes are part of the work; do not leave them untracked. Note membership is clone-portability on its own sentence; do not name OptMem in the prompt. Over-long note/nap prints Too long: N bytes, limit L; unknown id on identity-miss says copy from wake.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"4826b3cd066a8db2620210390a81c866632063b629b0c6d392ee396a30ce7a9a","sum":"Files the script writes are part of the work; do not leave them untracked. prompt-commit-notes archived (PR #15).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T143121Z-499b95db35c236dc","text":"Prompt: files the script writes are part of the work; do not leave them untracked. Not a separate git add procedure.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T143747Z-07042dccd58a8627","text":"prompt-commit-notes archived: files the script writes are part of your work; do not leave them untracked. Draft PR #15.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"0e2730939d36cf17a89286ebd9a998c74e328ccd4fe5e8f6b4894759e1fd26cb","sum":"Note membership is clone-portability on its own sentence; do not name OptMem in the prompt. Over-long note/nap prints Too long: N bytes, limit L; unknown id on identity-miss says copy from wake.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T144333Z-54317d52fae15bc6","text":"Note membership: session spawn 'document this machine gap' beat the baked filter because it is a trailing clause in the mandatory-note paragraph. Store/CLI stay; split the test onto its own clone-portability sentence. Do not name OptMem in the prompt.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T150951Z-48c09749f6b4d942","text":"Over-long note and nap captions print Too long: N bytes, limit L. Accented characters cost 2 bytes. Compress it further. Identity-miss unknown id says copy from wake; a missing children file does not.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"528f08ae8bb4cf55e61ee2cb2820b7ea4e7359fe50f27467eb457914754ecf88","sum":"Register Memories notes clone-portable facts (dump vs membership split); dump line does not say git forever. Onboarding is docs/agents-prompt.md lockstep with prompt_text(); TDD does not govern consumer Actions YAML that only invokes a third-party action.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"e2a8c1aafb975d1255be62cc74c014574166bc1501da4f799d2041e25d93f0b9","sum":"Baked Register Memories: note a fact another contributor would still need; membership is clone-portability on its own sentence (dump vs membership split). Dump line no longer says git forever.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T152829Z-ff3349020923cee6","text":"Baked Register Memories: note when another contributor would still need the fact; membership is clone-portability on its own sentence. Dump line no longer says git forever.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T165146Z-3869ac160fa1eda4","text":"Draft PR #18: baked Register Memories splits dump from clone-portability membership; no store/CLI change.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"89acc35894e248e23a8823606c8ba122a3a1931afff4346b729ba66d0334114f","sum":"Onboarding is docs/agents-prompt.md, lockstep with prompt_text(); do not select wrapping init output. TDD does not govern consumer Actions YAML that only invokes a third-party action; it would if SumMem were an Action.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T184134Z-2efc5cdcb2d8b149","text":"Onboarding prompt is docs/agents-prompt.md, lockstep with prompt_text(); do not select wrapping init output.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T193911Z-1a2508c0f3d6386f","text":"TDD does not govern GitHub Actions YAML that only invokes a third-party action; it would if SumMem were an Action.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
